    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean i cant really get to a doctor right now, it's late and i dont have a ride. plus like i said, i feel 100% normal now. it was just a few minutes of weirdness and then it was gone. it definitely doesnt feel like an emergency anymore since everything is back to normal. isnt it pretty common for these things to just happen and then pass? could it just be stress or something?",
